{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/d4720642269439c0aec913cefe2cf645.poster.avif?t=1760271896\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/d4720642269439c0aec913cefe2cf645.webm?t=1760271896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/d4720642269439c0aec913cefe2cf645.mp4?t=1760271896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Smash Out Colony</i> is a breakout-inspired horde survival game where timing is everything. Swing your hammer to deflect ricocheting projectiles, crush waves of enemies, and survive escalating chaos. With randomized upgrades, unique hammer types, and physics-driven mayhem, every run is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin-off to the award-winning <strong><i>Cast Out Colony</i></strong>, this fast-paced action game delivers tight mechanics, brutal enemy waves, and just enough unpredictability to keep you on your toes. You'll also see some familiar faces along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/bd98887c6a40208e93e342957cef8000.poster.avif?t=1760271896\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/bd98887c6a40208e93e342957cef8000.webm?t=1760271896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/extras/bd98887c6a40208e93e342957cef8000.mp4?t=1760271896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deflect to survive</strong> \u2013 Bounce projectiles into swarming enemies using perfectly timed hammer swings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique hammers</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of hammers, each with distinct stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and adapt</strong> \u2013 Pick from randomized upgrades to build your own survival strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless action</strong> \u2013 Face increasingly difficult enemies and intense boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based combat</strong> \u2013 Ricocheting projectiles keep every moment dynamic and skill-based.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2013 Randomized upgrades and varied enemy spawns keep each session fresh.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701810?t=1760271896","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/81ceff969ef9d2e034df083ff652eeae817e77fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760271896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/b7571dc677802f172395c8ac76ad5d4deba86773/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760271896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701810/b7571dc677802f172395c8ac76ad5d4deba86773/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760271896","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4079920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl